# Trial of Agony: two target creatures controlled by the same opponent (CR 115.1, 109.4), that player choosing which takes 5 damage and the other
# unable to block this turn (CR 509.1b). Bot1 refuses its own Bear and Mystic + Elves (two different opponents), then targets Bot2's Mystic
# and Memnite. Bot2, not Bot1, chooses: Memnite takes the 5 and dies, and Mystic is refused as a blocker while Bot2's untargeted Ornithopter may block.
# "This turn" only: in turn 6 Bot3's Llanowar Elves attacks Bot2, and the Mystic may block it again (both die).

